410	 * prompt. It varies every turn/channel, so putting it in the cached system
411	 * prefix would bust the prompt cache on every message. As the tail of the user
412	 * turn it appends after all cached content and costs nothing in cache terms.
413	 *
414	 * Only fields actually present are rendered — an empty/unknown field is omitted
415	 * rather than shown as "unknown". Returns "" when nothing is known, so the
416	 * caller can conditionally prepend it.
417	 */
